{"obsah":"<p>We have another one-day camp for women and girls behind us, created at the request of our clients and friends, and also thanks to interest from participants of the first camp. </p>\n\n<p>As interest in the camp was a bit greater than last time, we called to arms not only Katarína, Mára and Vlasta, but also Lukáš Valný, who was missing last time, and special thanks for rescuing the tent and looking after our things go to Matouš Balík from our home club. </p>\n\n<p>The morning programme was devoted to basic technique – in other words, we learn what we'll try to use off-road in the afternoon. At noon we rode at an easy pace to Hotel Legner Zvánovice, where all participants refuelled, and after a short break we practised off-road riding. </p>\n\n<p>There was also a workshop by Mára Tryner focused on classic bike maintenance and dealing with emergency situations riders may encounter on the bike. </p>\n\n<p>Thanks to all participants and instructors – hopefully we'll soon manage to put together next year's calendar with events for everyone.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2FIMG_20200920_171758.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"176315\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2FIMG_20200920_171758-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=176315\" class=\"wp-image-176315\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2FIMG_20200920_102003.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"176314\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2FIMG_20200920_102003-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=176314\" class=\"wp-image-176314\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2FAttachment0-2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"176313\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2FAttachment0-2.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=176313\" class=\"wp-image-176313\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2F20200920_161314.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"176312\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2F20200920_161314-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=176312\" class=\"wp-image-176312\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2F20200920_113349.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"176311\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2F20200920_113349-scaled.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=176311\" class=\"wp-image-176311\"/></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2020%2F09%2F20200920_110700.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"176310\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp